  <item>
    <title>Vol.17 年度圆桌会谈：生活多“焦绿&quot;，吐槽来“救局”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67582c7417cd5416adfe92a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67582c7417cd5416adfe92a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>北京时间<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a></span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>你的吐槽，我的烦恼好像不一样~点击收听我们的新一期播客:生活多“焦绿”，吐槽来“救局”。年末啦，没想到2024已经接近尾声了，我们也到了期末周，九七的毕设、yoyo的身材管理、西卡的论文，我们都急需拉动进度条，火速快进到放假过年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了吐槽外，我们还是怀着“感恩的心”，感谢大家的关注，熄灯后正式到达500位粉丝啦!欢迎大家在评论区留言，我们会送出精美小礼品作为小福利~被抽中的朋友可以加九七的联系方式兑换礼物喔！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这世界纷纷扰扰，希望熄灯后可以成为你独属的小天地~这里是”喜欢您来“的熄灯后~</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期福利</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>我们熄灯后破500订阅量咯~给大家准备了小惊喜，随机掉落~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参与条件：1.订阅我们的节目《熄灯后After hours》+评论我们的节目（任何一期都有可能掉落哦~）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.粉丝群的乖乖也会随机掉落哦~</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>福利奖品</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>电影票：《好东西》或者《小小的我》二选一</span></strong><span>（添加九七的联系方式备注熄灯后+电影名）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>正片开启~</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a>我们的节目订阅量突破500啦，随机掉落小惊喜~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>年末圆桌会谈正式开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a>西卡的期末周</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a>九七的毕设，到底是谁发明的论文啊，救命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a>我要一辈子爱上中医了，无痛减肥！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a>看到减肥中数字的变化，会焦绿吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a>噗噗小方法，总有一个方法适合你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a>每个人都有一个年度的sologan</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a>mbti还能变的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a>演唱会经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a>随机惊喜的来源于西卡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a>找到了人生香水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a>吐槽卫生巾，女性用品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2079">34:39</a>人生就是来疯狂的，船到桥头自然直</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a>有了期待的事情，每天都很快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a>感谢陪伴我们节目成长的各位，祝我们都能找到热爱的事情，所向披靡！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢各位的收听和支持。晚安！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>—主持—</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>九七</span></p><span></span><p><span>西卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>柚柚</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿方式：jiuqi9703@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
